## Deployment

{% if runtime == "docker" %}
```bash
cd /path/to/{{ project_name }}
docker compose up -d
docker logs {{ agent_name | lower }}-gateway -f
```
{% elif runtime == "systemd" or runtime == "bare-metal" %}
```bash
sudo cp deploy/openclaw.service /etc/systemd/system/openclaw-{{ agent_name | lower }}.service
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now openclaw-{{ agent_name | lower }}
```
{% endif %}

## Secrets

Bot tokens and API keys are **never** committed. Store in:
- `~/.openclaw/secrets/discord.env`
- `~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent/auth-profiles.json`
